!phase-2-exact-model/artifacts/figures/
!phase-2-exact-model/artifacts/figures/*.pdf
!phase-2-exact-model/artifacts/figures/*.png
!phase-2-exact-model/artifacts/summary.csv
!phase-2-exact-model/artifacts/summary.json
!phase-2-exact-model/artifacts/theorem-checks.json

# Stage 4 raw training state is reproducible but too large and machine-specific
