phase-4-learned-audit/rescue-runs/
phase-4-learned-audit/development/
phase-4-learned-audit/logs/
phase-4-learned-audit/artifacts/checkpoints/
phase-4-learned-audit/artifacts/raw-rollouts/

# Stage 6 uses isolated upstream runtimes and file-based interchange.  Compact
